module compiled ahead: key its source's (AotKey; \"\" for the main module,"] [51 1 "// which AotMain runs from its text), ir its IR text, natives its code objects' functions in pre-order."] [59 1 "// aotAttach is ReadIR's hook: the native functions of a registered IR text set on its code objects."] [86 1 "// aotCompile is a compiled program's compiler (SetCompiler): a source compiled ahead, else the host's IR cache's"] [87 1 "// answer, else the host's."] [98 1 "// The host's IR cache (202b): the host's compiler (arbace.python.run/compile-source) keeps each answer it can keep in"] [99 1 "// WORK/ir-cache/KK/KEY, KEY the SHA-256 of \"MODE\\x00DIGEST\\x00SOURCE\", DIGEST its compiler's (the SHA-256 of its"] [100 1 "// sources). The compiler's script (PYI_AOT_COMPILER, bin/pyi's aot_module) names them on a line \"# ir-cache: DIR"] [101 1 "// DIGEST\"; a compiled program reads that cache itself, the answer the host would read first, so a run whose sources"] [102 1 "// at run time were all compiled before starts no host (about 0.6 s of every compiled program's start on the VM)."] [145 1 "// hostCompile asks the host's compiler (the command PYI_AOT_COMPILER names, started once: arbace.python.aot"] [146 1 "// compile-server) for source's IR: a request \"MODE\\tFILE\\tBYTES\\n\" and the source, an answer \"BYTES\\n\""] [147 1 "// and the compiler's text (arbace.python.run/compile-source's: the IR, SyntaxError: ..., incomplete)."] [198 1 "// AotMain is a compiled program's process: sys.argv and sys.path as bin/pyi run gives them, the"] [199 1 "// compiler of source at run time, the main module's IR run as __main__ (RunModule); the exit status."] [200 1 "// PYI_AOT_STATS names a file for the code objects run compiled and on the loop, and the host's compiles."] [222 1 "// AotBadPC is a compiled function entered at a PC that is not an instruction's."] [227 1 "// The helpers of the compiled code: each is an operation of step's switch (eval.go) with its argument"] [228 1 "// a constant; the ones that may raise return the error, a call also a *pushFrame."] [415 1 "// AotToBool is to-bool (not false) and not (not true)."] [552 1 "// AotForIter is for-iter: the next item pushed (false), or at the end the iterator popped (true)."] [557 22 "// FOR_ITER clears a raised StopIteration: the loop's end"] [570 1 "// AotTruthy is the popped value's truth (the conditional jumps')."] [604 1 "// AotCall is call [N KWNAMES] (kw the kwnames tuple's constant index, or -1): a Python function's"] [605 1 "// frame pushed (the *pushFrame returned: f.PC must be the next instruction's), a generator made, or"] [606 1 "// any other callable called."] [666 1 "// AotExec runs instruction i of f's code as step runs it, for the operations the compiled code does not"] [667 1 "// spell out: the rarer ones of step's switch and every operation another file registers (RegisterOp)."] [668 1 "// f.PC is the next instruction's when it is called; an operation that jumps sets it."] [800 1 "// AotPopIsNone pops the top and tells whether it is None (jump-if-none, jump-if-not-none)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[70 32] [89 47] [92 40] [111 43] [112 34] [114 54] [115 44] [159 42] [161 40] [175 86] [190 41] [204 37] [205 28] [215 36] [306 41] [319 36] [339 57] [459 12] [459 28] [460 40] [472 22] [537 25] [537 33] [556 28] [621 47] [626 35] [677 29] [685 62] [690 24] [693 62] [700 44] [707 29] [717 17] [717 31] [721 22] [721 30] [732 37] [751 30]]} (go/file "aot.go" :imports [


